1140: SLPI stage 1: fix the cmd-db lookup of lcx.lvl/lmx.lvl and dump the cmd-db. bergamota_rpmh_lookup() matches VRM (regulator)
entries only, so an ARC resource failed with "invalid VRM entry", errno 22, although it exists. New read-only
bergamota_rpmh_lookup_arc(res, &addr, &levels) and bergamota_rpmh_dump() (every entry name, type and address, four per line);
stage 1 (bergamotaslpi=1) dumps the cmd-db and then looks lcx/lmx up as ARC. Applies on top of 1137.

